<title>USA: Nevada Energy names acting president.</title>
<headline>Nevada Energy names acting president.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nevada Energy Co said Friday it has appointed Stefan Tevis as acting president.</p>
<p>Tevis, previously chairman of Contract Multi-Media Specialists Inc, replaces Jeffrey Antisdel.</p>
<p>The company also said that Richard Cascarilla has been replaced as secretary and treasurer by Kenton Bowers.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to consult with Cascarilla and Antisdel on the expansion and development of its energy division.</p>
